  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhjiYJPAm84oR3355jnNlHmNwiPqVmvALUOfbGD4zU52Ki1L4KhkX-u7PehC4FMyNeLEWRp7902hChkHdOJkXbvYISL4fC3sW1R-KGIJ0pmghlHxc-GjbvJnWnrLtbgtAorCJfU9-uyj4NXxingMIUxQOuOLMcckSrr5WGrDqnQRyK-xKVDlJtvJuN8_pQ/w200-h183/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"text-align: center;\" /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><h2><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>בְּכַעֲסוֹ</b><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">- הַדִּין אֶת הָהָר יִקֹּב.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>בְּזַעְמוֹ</b><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">- אֶת שֵׁם אֱלֹהָיו יִקֹּב.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>בְּחָלְיוֹ</b><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">- אָנוּשׁ הַלֵּב וְעָקֹב.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ***</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>כִּי בַּחֲמָתוֹ</b><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">- בֵּרַךְ אֱלֹהִים וָמֶלֶךְ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>וּבְזַעְפּוֹ</b><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">- הֵקֵל כָּל עֵרֶךְ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>וְסוֹפוֹ</b><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">- זָב וּמְצֹרָע וּמַחֲזִיק בַּפֶּלֶךְ</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">.</span></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כְּשֶׁהַכַּעַס מְבַקֵּשׁ פֶּה -<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">תֵּן לוֹ לֵב.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אַל תְּגַיֵּס אֶת הַקֶּצֶף.</span></p><p></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><p><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מַעֲשֶׂה - חוֹלֵף,<br />\nמִלָּה כְּעוּסָה - נִשְׁאֶרֶת.</span></p><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2></span><p><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-family: arial;\">סיפורו של המקלל מובא בסוף פרשת <b>אמור</b>, שלאחריה פרשת <b>בהר סיני</b>.<br />לומר לך:<br />- שקילל את שם השם אותו שמע בהר סיני.<br />- שנענש כמו שצוה ה' את משה על הקרב להר - סקל יסקל.<br /></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-family: arial;\">(בעל הטורים)</span></p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></b></i></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"></span></p></span><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; counter-reset: templateify 0; margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px 20px 0px 0px;\"><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">'<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">וַיִּקֹּב</span></b></i>' / '<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">וּפָרֵישׁ</span></b></i>'<br /><span><span><span>❖ אמירה חדה, נקובה - מפורשת</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">'<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">יִקְרְחוּ</span></b></i>' / '<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">יִמְרְטוּן</span></b></i>'<br /><span><span><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span>&nbsp;תלישת שיער</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">'<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">יוּצַק</span></b></i>' / '<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">יִתָּרַק</span></b></i>'<br /><span><span><span>❖ שפיכה - הורקה</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">'<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">פִסֵּחַ</span></b></i>' / '<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">חֲגִיר</span></b></i>'<br /><span><span><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span>&nbsp;צולע - חיגר</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">'<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">שֶׁרֶץ</span></b></i>' / '<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">רִחְשָׁא</span></b></i>'<br /><span><span><span>❖ מתנועע נמוך ורוחש</span></span></span></span></li></ol><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div><br /></div><h2 style=\"display: inline; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"></span></div>👁️ מבט חד</span><br /></h2><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"float: right;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiT9iTQvqJJ0WfQy-FsSVK8-mU6fGEfcnxHUk3yjHcgtn7ienvJqMruLTKSK0CwJMa6rkqGLenkVtN_cAaVhBt6FcUXWwpv7sFtCKQMsiTvwM1u4XpkhrDJkkq56Xbvz9Ne1gbTOa9cPwgQwGhxNhw1sb6zRhIvB11XOO3OyrrwoBRiYWemPDTqCF3LakI/s1536/ChatGPT%20Image%20Jan%204,%202026,%2005_35_19%20PM.png\" style=\"clear: right; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img alt=\"אבן כבדה נושרת מפה פתוח בכעס\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1536\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiT9iTQvqJJ0WfQy-FsSVK8-mU6fGEfcnxHUk3yjHcgtn7ienvJqMruLTKSK0CwJMa6rkqGLenkVtN_cAaVhBt6FcUXWwpv7sFtCKQMsiTvwM1u4XpkhrDJkkq56Xbvz9Ne1gbTOa9cPwgQwGhxNhw1sb6zRhIvB11XOO3OyrrwoBRiYWemPDTqCF3LakI/w133-h200/ChatGPT%20Image%20Jan%204,%202026,%2005_35_19%20PM.png\" width=\"133\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">קללה - תקלה כבדה</td></tr></tbody></table><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div></span></div></div><br />"
